{
 "uid": "flechtwerk-f1-season",
 "title": "Flechtwerk — F1 Season",
 "description": "The entry point: every session on tape, with one click to open the race wall at it and one to replay it. Keep this dashboard's time range NOW-RELATIVE — the replay link passes ${__to} as the wall-clock instant the replay starts from, and an absolute range would freeze it (the race wall's `play_ms` textbox is the manual fallback).",
 "tags": [
  "flechtwerk",
  "f1"
 ],
 "timezone": "",
 "schemaVersion": 39,
 "version": 1,
 "refresh": "1m",
 "time": {
  "from": "now-1y",
  "to": "now"
 },
 "timepicker": {},
 "templating": {
  "list": [
   {
    "type": "custom",
    "name": "entity",
    "label": "Championship",
    "query": "driver,team",
    "includeAll": false,
    "multi": false,
    "options": [
     {
      "text": "driver",
      "value": "driver",
      "selected": true
     },
     {
      "text": "team",
      "value": "team",
      "selected": false
     }
    ],
    "current": {
     "text": "driver",
     "value": "driver"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
 "annotations": {
  "list": []
 },
 "panels": [
  {
   "id": 1,
   "type": "table",
   "title": "Sessions on Tape — Open One, or Replay It",
   "description": "Every session ingested, newest first. The two data links on `label` are the point of this dashboard: **open** hands the race wall the session key and a window padded to the tape (from −15 min, because recording starts ~50 min before lights-out, to +60 min, because the tape outlives the flag); **▶ replay** adds the virtual-clock variables so the wall re-runs the session from its start at ${speed}×. The replay link needs THIS dashboard to keep a now-relative range, because it passes ${__to} as the wall-clock moment the replay began — if you have pinned an absolute range here, type the current epoch-ms into the wall's `play_ms` box instead.",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource",
    "uid": "clickhouse"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 12
   },
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {},
    "overrides": [
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "label"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "custom.width",
        "value": 380
       },
       {
        "id": "links",
        "value": [
         {
          "title": "Open the race wall at this session",
          "url": "/d/flechtwerk-f1/flechtwerk-f1-live-timing?var-session=${__data.fields.session_key}&var-mode=wall&var-speed=5&var-play_ms=0&var-race_start_ms=0&from=${__data.fields.from_ms}&to=${__data.fields.to_ms}",
          "targetBlank": false
         },
         {
          "title": "▶ Replay this session on the race wall",
          "url": "/d/flechtwerk-f1/flechtwerk-f1-live-timing?var-session=${__data.fields.session_key}&var-mode=replay&var-speed=5&var-play_ms=${__to}&var-race_start_ms=${__data.fields.from_ms}&from=${__data.fields.from_ms}&to=${__data.fields.to_ms}",
          "targetBlank": false
         },
         {
          "title": "📈 Strategy view for this session",
          "url": "/d/flechtwerk-f1-strategy/flechtwerk-f1-strategy?var-session=${__data.fields.session_key}&from=${__data.fields.from_ms}&to=${__data.fields.to_ms}",
          "targetBlank": false
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "session_key"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "custom.width",
        "value": 100
       },
       {
        "id": "unit",
        "value": "none"
       },
       {
        "id": "decimals",
        "value": 0
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "from_ms"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "custom.hidden",
        "value": true
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "to_ms"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "custom.hidden",
        "value": true
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "status"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "custom.width",
        "value": 110
       },
       {
        "id": "custom.cellOptions",
        "value": {
         "type": "color-background",
         "mode": "basic"
        }
       },
       {
        "id": "mappings",
        "value": [
         {
          "type": "value",
          "options": {
           "Ends": {
            "text": "complete",
            "color": "green",
            "index": 0
           },
           "Finalised": {
            "text": "finalised",
            "color": "green",
            "index": 1
           },
           "Started": {
            "text": "LIVE",
            "color": "red",
            "index": 2
           },
           "Finished": {
            "text": "finished",
            "color": "blue",
            "index": 3
           },
           "Inactive": {
            "text": "inactive",
            "color": "text",
            "index": 4
           },
           "Aborted": {
            "text": "aborted",
            "color": "orange",
            "index": 5
           }
          }
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   "options": {
    "showHeader": true,
    "cellHeight": "sm"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource",
      "uid": "clickhouse"
     },
     "editorType": "sql",
     "queryType": "table",
     "format": 1,
     "rawSql": "SELECT session_key, label, session_name, status,\n       start_utc, circuit, country,\n       toUnixTimestamp64Milli(start_utc) - 15 * 60 * 1000 AS from_ms,\n       toUnixTimestamp64Milli(end_utc) + 60 * 60 * 1000   AS to_ms\nFROM flechtwerk.f1_sessions FINAL\nORDER BY start_utc DESC, session_key DESC"
    }
   ]
  },
